# CI 脚本与工作流必须是 LF 行尾, 否则在 Linux 容器里执行会报 bad interpreter / 语法错误
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# 源码/配置统一 text 属性: git 内部规范化行尾(LF), diff 忽略 CRLF/LF 差异
*.cs    text
*.csproj text
*.cpp   text
*.hpp   text
*.ps1   text
*.md    text
*.json  text
*.txt   text

# NX 菜单/工具栏文件是 GBK 编码, 禁止 autocrlf/文本归一化改写 (规范 C1/M2)
*.men  binary
*.rtb  binary
*.tbr  binary
